    "description": "Title\n: Unbranded Pipe Stand Tobacco Humidor Caddy Set With Pipes Ashtray Wood Storage Lot\nOptional title\n: Vintage Wooden Pipe Rack Set with Pipes and Ashtray\nBrand\n: Unbranded\nColor\n: Brown\nDepartment\n: Collectibles & Art\nCategory\n: Collectibles & Art\nType\n: Pipes\nCondition\n: Fair - shows sign of wear\nDescription\n: Elevate your display or personal collection with this classic vintage wooden pipe rack set, crafted with timeless appeal and functional design. Perfect for collectors or pipe smokers, this set includes a handsome wooden rack with multiple slots for holding pipes, a matching humidor compartment with a hinged lid for storing tobacco or accessories, and a glass-inset ashtray with a wooden rest. Three pipes and cleaning accessories, such as Thoro-Kleen pipe cleaners, are included to complete the ensemble. The sturdy wood construction and smooth finish ensure long-lasting beauty and durability, while the practical glass ashtray combines easy cleaning with a stylish look. Ideal for organizing your pipes or creating a refined centerpiece for any study, den, or man cave. Shop confidently knowing you'll receive an authentic piece that blends vintage charm with everyday utility, designed for both display and regular use. Each piece is inspected for quality to ensure your satisfaction.\nUNBRANDED Pipes\nThis is a pre-owned item donated to Goodwill of Northern Michigan.\nPlease see images for further detail and ask any questions you may have before making a bid.\nItems have been tested for power, not function. In some instances we may not have the necessary equipment to test certain electronics therefore all items will be auctioned off AS-IS with no refunds.\nItems in lots are sold as-is, are not eligible for refunds, and may not be individually wrapped.\nPlease contact us before making payment to review combined shipping options.\nPick-Ups\nWe're open Monday - Friday, 8 am - 4 pm. We are closed on weekends and major holidays. For local pickup in Traverse City, please give us 24 hours from time of payment to prepare your order. Thank you!",
